{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a8c6212b9d31eb56800a1d8d185e980ad30d677ab98f623b6346f4d22eb491a2", "ja": "（今日は奈緒のPV撮影だ。撮影を楽しみにしてた\nみたいだけど……そろそろ準備できたかな？）", "zh": "（今天是奈绪的PV拍摄。她好像一直很期待拍摄……差不多准备好了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "1a2e2c1bab8bbde132586cd51a05fe32d90c4af03db755eb24fc02bb1a5fd9ab", "ja": "{$P$}さん、教えてください！\n私、ちゃんとアイドルとして成長できてますか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请告诉我！\n我有好好成长为一名偶像吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8f5896d50cd9bae5c27ced3c9aec712bcbf0d8fc2032e0d575f1b09b65be12f7", "ja": "えっ？　うん、ちゃんと成長してると思うけど……\nどうしたんだ急に？", "zh": "诶？嗯，我觉得你确实在好好成长，不过……\n怎么突然问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "6e1444eb4ef0efa39efa25d527f1197e8ba0fd9bc14e2eecf2a69e6366d9336a", "ja": "実は……さっき電話かかってきたんです。\n大阪におった時、近所に住んでたオバちゃんから。", "zh": "其实……刚才有人给我打电话了。\n是在大阪的时候，住我家附近的婶婶打来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "a9967f53d81b93e1e59ce93b2be72bfb8fb1609b1679489f15ecc35dfa5105ed", "ja": "「奈緒ちゃん、日本一のアイドルになれたん？」って\n言われて……。", "zh": "问我“奈绪，你成日本第一的偶像了吗？”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1005_p", "source_sha256": "161e3a32137e7e4e1bb142ffe06a1ce90cabf64c53adc6bdc09d28d73b939ce9", "ja": "オバちゃん……ああ、地元で\n奈緒を応援してくれているっていう？", "zh": "大婶……啊，你是说那位在老家一直支持奈绪的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "d80ca3d5661a210f695ebd1737fc4bbdd54fd04ef2beee5f1f24d66282d2ed4d", "ja": "そうそう、その人です！\n私が上京してからも、時々、電話くれて。", "zh": "对对，就是那个人！  \n自从我来到东京以后，她也时不时打电话给我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "bd64e2c964367400664011a4870fffb8fa7bd9cfe74ba6cb8cc01d71b2df0637", "ja": "私、つい見栄張っちゃって。思わず\n「心配せんでええ。任しとき！」って答えてしもて。", "zh": "我啊，忍不住逞强了。脱口而出就回答说\n\"别担心啦，交给我就行！\"", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "391fc87e5c0a7ba00dcae4929de8dc30c0b90affc149653d708c28377bd63f3a", "ja": "でも、だんだん不安になってきて。\n私、ちゃんと成長できてるんかな……って。", "zh": "可是，我渐渐开始不安起来了。\n我真的有在好好成长吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "8bffe485770dfbbdf6df0e29dfbb628a4a499367ad6fa9920ddeff68030a8f87", "ja": "あー！　なんであないなこと言うてしまったんやー！\n私のアホーーーーーっ！", "zh": "啊——！我怎么就说出那种话了啊——！\n我这个笨蛋————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ed41f3ff563a765e9b1b6214cdbe8f240408f2fe7ef7e8b26e756686b08c1103", "ja": "まぁまぁ。少し落ち着こう。\nきっとその人も、奈緒のことが心配だったんだよ。", "zh": "好啦好啦。稍微冷静一下。\n那个人肯定也是因为担心奈绪嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "2fb189d36150e0bda7f46d907043de71363c9a98f1e4c31ac1669c0e6c1f9b72", "ja": "うう、そうですかね？", "zh": "呜呜，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1012_p", "source_sha256": "33d99b728474b25bcd7c785d9e6dae709ada483e6af19758fac2fb96620841b5", "ja": "ああ。そうやって奈緒を気にかけてくれるなんて、\n優しい人じゃないか。", "zh": "是啊。你能这样关心奈绪，真是个温柔的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "c5bf92b0d12849767f866ee05c9679e2a8fdf5c43be3b42abeefaa0dfa917752", "ja": "そうなんです！　近所のオバちゃんだけやなくて、\nみーんな、私のことメッチャ気にかけてくれて……。", "zh": "就是这样！不只是附近的大婶，大家都特别关心我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "561c8cafc8afd36959888fcbdc97721a062a018adce03c12660dd936b1f68d31", "ja": "家族も地元の友達も、たこ焼き屋のオバちゃんも。\n古着屋のお姉さんと、それからジョンと……。", "zh": "家人、老家的朋友，还有章鱼烧店的大妈。\n古着店的大姐，另外还有约翰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7fdb744508e74ea6fc7956493cf444f58665db682454b4db96eed8da551e988c", "ja": "ジョン……？", "zh": "约翰……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "13f0e3391ef97fc1dc62b4408dd1d7d325b380ccf3d62ae92c9d5b333bcc62c1", "ja": "はい。実家の近所の犬で、\nめっちゃかわいい子……やなくて！", "zh": "是的，是我老家附近的一只狗，超级可爱……不对，不是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "3e6fd28f1ae4dae90e77da3c1929ebf73b73506f42e2340ff4c8c79103f938f9", "ja": "みんな優しいんです。私が上京する時なんて、\n駅まで見送りに来てくれたんです……！", "zh": "大家都很温柔。在我来东京的时候，他们还特意送我到了车站……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bb8d425bfccc4245660e67486e02c5143225ae681b0881b4c493466fabb60d0d", "ja": "そうか。奈緒を送り出してくれた人たちが\nガッカリしないか、心配だったってことか。", "zh": "这样啊。你是担心送奈绪来东京的人们会不会失望，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a0c2183c620032361ffffc4c45883499dec6f5a167c39104c574ad823dba1bb4", "ja": "なら、今日の撮影は頑張らないとな。\n以前とは違う……成長した奈緒の姿をみてもらおう！", "zh": "那今天的拍摄可得好好努力了。让他们看看与以前不同的……已经成长起来的奈绪吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "2aac36c3ef19b9413767554e778f035a636cd45a6d8370aa056ada58c59299f5", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。そうですね！\n口だけやない……ちゃんと行動で証明してみせます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……是啊！\n不会只停留在嘴上说说……我会用实际行动证明给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0354_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "95aa880c975a4b253b498cd8bc7174e0e11571ad00f550f23455bc703188cce4", "ja": "ありがとうございます、おかげで気合い入りました。\nよっしゃー！　今日の撮影、全力でいっくでー！", "zh": "谢谢您，托您的福我干劲满满啦。\n好嘞——！今天的拍摄，我要全力以赴啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
